-------------------------------------------------
 Finalize HashAggregate
   Group Key: lion_part.a
   ->  Custom Scan (LionCount)
         Partitions: lion_part_p1, lion_part_def
         Lion Indexes: (a), (k = ANY ({2,25}))
         Group Key: a
(6 rows)

